1
00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:20,120
Preparation time is over.

2
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:21,960
Marshal, please take your seat.

3
00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:23,890
Lead actor, please take the stage.

4
00:00:25,240 --> 00:00:26,400
Yang,

5
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:29,760
Xiao Han, remember what Master Gu said.

6
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:33,600
The lead actor should wear
the blood-stained robe.

7
00:00:33,760 --> 00:00:35,800
If no blood is shed tonight,

8
00:00:36,360 --> 00:00:38,120
no one will survive.

9
00:00:38,160 --> 00:00:41,840
This time, I won't let anyone die here.

10
00:00:52,480 --> 00:00:53,600
Do not come out.

11
00:00:53,880 --> 00:00:58,240
Actor, this blade has tasted
the blood of 47 marshals.

12
00:00:58,520 --> 00:01:02,000
Tonight, it will taste its 48th.

13
00:01:02,800 --> 00:01:05,120
Act Three: Blood Sacrifice
in the Pear Garden.

14
00:01:05,120 --> 00:01:06,440
Slay the destined one.

15
00:01:06,440 --> 00:01:07,760
Pierce the target's heart

16
00:01:07,760 --> 00:01:08,840
to end this act.

17
00:01:16,720 --> 00:01:18,760
Xiao Han, do it.

18
00:01:18,760 --> 00:01:20,320
You told me to follow
the system's rules before,

19
00:01:20,320 --> 00:01:21,200
and I did.

20
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:22,360
Now it's your turn.

21
00:01:22,360 --> 00:01:23,680
Kill me according to the rules

22
00:01:23,680 --> 00:01:25,000
and get out alive.

23
00:01:25,320 --> 00:01:26,250
Don't be stupid.

24
00:01:26,400 --> 00:01:28,800
I'm waiting for her
to expose her weak spot.

25
00:01:30,840 --> 00:01:32,920
Qiqi, Lin Xiaofei, stick to the plan.

26
00:01:38,280 --> 00:01:41,080
We absolutely cannot let them
interfere with Han.

27
00:01:42,400 --> 00:01:43,680
Pang, I'll cover you.

28
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:44,320
Go get ready.

29
00:01:44,320 --> 00:01:46,520
Stab him.

30
00:01:46,600 --> 00:01:49,120
Complete this perfect sacrifice.

31
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:51,000
Forty-seven years of waiting,

32
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:52,800
all for this moment.

33
00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:55,800
It's okay. If someone has to die,

34
00:01:56,240 --> 00:01:57,440
let it be me.

35
00:01:57,440 --> 00:01:58,800
Even if I kill you,

36
00:01:58,840 --> 00:02:00,120
we won't get out.

37
00:02:00,120 --> 00:02:02,200
We'll just become puppets on this stage.

38
00:02:02,200 --> 00:02:04,520
This broken system
doesn't dictate my life.

39
00:02:04,520 --> 00:02:06,480
There is no room for personal feelings
under the blade.

40
00:02:06,480 --> 00:02:07,640
But this time,

41
00:02:08,039 --> 00:02:09,160
to survive...

42
00:02:10,360 --> 00:02:12,080
Master, I understand now.

43
00:02:12,080 --> 00:02:13,840
It's not about having
no personal feelings,

44
00:02:13,840 --> 00:02:15,440
but pointing the blade at the real enemy

45
00:02:15,440 --> 00:02:17,200
to protect friends.

46
00:02:19,320 --> 00:02:21,520
Han, we are ready.

47
00:02:21,600 --> 00:02:22,160
Han,

48
00:02:22,280 --> 00:02:23,400
let's move together.

49
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:24,200
Now!

50
00:02:31,160 --> 00:02:33,560
Don't even think about ruining my plan.

51
00:02:36,520 --> 00:02:37,320
Ignore us!

52
00:02:37,320 --> 00:02:38,180
Stab the chair!

53
00:02:48,400 --> 00:02:49,660
Don't blame yourself.

54
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:53,520
Do you think your broken body

55
00:02:53,960 --> 00:02:56,920
can fight 47 years of resentment?

56
00:02:57,520 --> 00:02:59,160
The more you struggle,

57
00:02:59,440 --> 00:03:01,160
the more they suffer.

58
00:03:01,160 --> 00:03:02,600
My shoulder!

59
00:03:02,600 --> 00:03:03,560
Every ten breaths,

60
00:03:03,560 --> 00:03:05,320
I will break one of their bones.

61
00:03:06,160 --> 00:03:07,800
Kill the marshal,

62
00:03:07,800 --> 00:03:09,600
and they will be free.

63
00:03:10,120 --> 00:03:12,560
Xiao Han, stab him!

64
00:03:15,320 --> 00:03:16,600
What did you say?

65
00:03:17,520 --> 00:03:19,440
I said, stab him!

66
00:03:20,040 --> 00:03:21,920
My life for their three lives.

67
00:03:21,920 --> 00:03:24,850
It's a good deal.
Aren't you best at this kind of math?

68
00:03:31,400 --> 00:03:33,800
Thank you, Dr. Xiao.

69
00:03:34,600 --> 00:03:35,660
I'm sorry, Master.

70
00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:36,520
I was soft-hearted

71
00:03:36,520 --> 00:03:37,720
and deceived by them,

72
00:03:37,720 --> 00:03:38,720
which led you to investigate

73
00:03:38,720 --> 00:03:39,720
and get killed.

74
00:03:41,760 --> 00:03:43,600
You got me killed.

75
00:03:43,600 --> 00:03:45,600
I have no such apprentice.

76
00:03:45,920 --> 00:03:49,160
Three years ago, I made the wrong choice
because I was soft-hearted.

77
00:03:49,160 --> 00:03:52,640
Must I kill the person in front of me now
for the same reason?

78
00:03:53,760 --> 00:03:56,240
It's finally over.

79
00:04:00,400 --> 00:04:03,000
Listen to me. The dagger goes in three
centimeters, two centimeters to the left,

80
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:04,360
avoiding the heart and aortic groove.

81
00:04:04,360 --> 00:04:05,360
You'll bleed a lot,

82
00:04:05,360 --> 00:04:06,200
but you won't die.

83
00:04:06,200 --> 00:04:07,440
Keep playing along.

84
00:04:07,440 --> 00:04:09,960
The blood loss is enough to meet
the chair's sacrificial requirement.

85
00:04:09,960 --> 00:04:12,400
The moment Su Lingyue lets her guard down,

86
00:04:13,240 --> 00:04:15,370
you have to bet she'll show a weakness.

87
00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:17,640
I'm not betting. I calculated it.

88
00:04:17,959 --> 00:04:19,420
This is the only solution.

89
00:04:19,760 --> 00:04:21,720
Do it. I trust you.

90
00:04:25,960 --> 00:04:27,240
It worked.

91
00:04:28,200 --> 00:04:30,360
It finally worked.

92
00:04:36,400 --> 00:04:37,760
Blood loss is about 300 milliliters.

93
00:04:37,760 --> 00:04:38,640
Still in the safe zone.

94
00:04:38,640 --> 00:04:39,480
Wait another 15 seconds.

95
00:04:39,480 --> 00:04:41,440
I finally smell fresh blood.

96
00:04:43,400 --> 00:04:45,800
You're treating me like a case
on the dissection table.

97
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:46,680
Hold on a little longer.

98
00:04:46,680 --> 00:04:50,400
Three, two, one.

99
00:04:50,400 --> 00:04:52,000
Now!

100
00:04:58,800 --> 00:05:00,960
No! What are you doing?

101
00:05:12,320 --> 00:05:14,240
Tell me how to destroy it!

102
00:05:14,400 --> 00:05:17,800
A dagger alone can't kill it.

103
00:05:18,400 --> 00:05:21,760
It needs the fire of the same origin.

104
00:05:22,880 --> 00:05:24,480
What is the fire of the same origin?

105
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:26,410
What is the fire of the same origin?

106
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:31,840
The script.

107
00:05:37,840 --> 00:05:41,280
The script. Su Lingyue
is talking about the script.

108
00:05:45,440 --> 00:05:47,640
At the opening of the first act,

109
00:05:47,680 --> 00:05:50,800
Su Lingyue was holding a yellowed script.

110
00:05:50,800 --> 00:05:52,200
I saw it when I was managing
the costume trunks.

111
00:05:52,200 --> 00:05:53,600
At the very bottom of the backstage trunk,

112
00:05:53,600 --> 00:05:54,760
wrapped in red silk.

113
00:05:57,600 --> 00:05:59,000
Go find it! Pang and I

114
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:00,060
will hold them off.

115
00:06:04,560 --> 00:06:06,040
Where? Where is it?

116
00:06:23,160 --> 00:06:24,840
The script is here!
